          "min_hold_days": 2,
          "one_r_definition": "Engine has no explicit protective-stop R unit (swing-low risk is computed at entry for logging only and is not a stop). 1R is defined as 3.0% of current avg entry \u2014 the same gain threshold already used to promote probe\u2192confirm in bba-engine/hl_backtest.py. Unrealized is price gain vs avg entry, not net of funding.",
